#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/statusphere-tutorial/en.mdx:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Tap](/guides/backfilling#using-tap) is the best way to synchronize and stream AT Protocol records. You'll use the Tap [TypeScript library](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@atproto/tap) to sync new records in your database. Create `lib/tap/index.ts`:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/statusphere-tutorial/en.mdx:133
#, no-wrap
